# Files

This folder is the whole prototype. Static HTML for GitHub Pages. No bundler, no npm, no edits in `twin-frontend`.

Relative paths only (`css/app.css`, `js/…`). Hash router in `js/boot.js`. Script order is the list in `index.html` — do not reorder casually.

| Change | File |
|---|---|
| Page intro / walkthrough / assistant / AI insight | `js/guide.js` + CSS in `app.css` |
| Mock / NAV / presets | `js/data.js` |
| Entity CRUD (create / view / edit / versions) | `js/entity-crud.js` |
| Pins, setup checklist | `js/state.js` |
| Card markup | `js/cards.js` |
| Card CSS | `css/app.css` (`.entity-card`) |
| Card canon (spec page) | `js/screens-lab.js` (`CARD_CANON`) + route `#/lab/cards` |
| Page shell canon | `js/screens-lab.js` (`PAGE_SHELL_CANON`) + route `#/lab/page` |
| New sidebar section | `data.js` NAV + `screens-ops.js` + route in `boot.js` |
| Account screens | `js/screens-account.js` |

Keep screens split the way they are. Do not merge back into one `app.js`.

Minimum code. No extra features, no canvas, no NLU trainer. If a section exists in the current LK, map it into this IA (pin or tab) — do not copy the old 30-item menu.
